ok 1 - service CAS creates head revision 1
ok 2 - service CAS advances head 1 -> 2 with the expected hash
ok 3 - stale expected revision is a CAS conflict
ok 4 - service reads the head directly (SELECT only)
ok 5 - service cannot bypass CAS with a direct UPDATE
ok 6 - service cannot bypass CAS with a direct INSERT
ok 7 - service cannot delete heads
ok 8 - authenticated cannot execute native CAS
ok 9 - authenticated cannot read native heads
ok 10 - anon cannot execute native CAS
ok 11 - anon cannot read native heads
