ok 16 - user A cannot delete external leagues
ok 17 - user A cannot call the token reader RPC
ok 18 - anon cannot read connected accounts
ok 19 - anon cannot read provider sync runs
ok 20 - service inserts a schedule row (identity default)
ok 21 - service cannot reset the schedule identity sequence
ok 22 - anon reads the schedule row
ok 23 - anon cannot delete schedule rows
ok 24 - anon cannot draw from the schedule sequence
ok 25 - authenticated reads the schedule
ok 26 - authenticated cannot update schedule rows
